// agent is its own Python project (uv-managed, .venv/ at this
// directory) — separate from simulators/aq-simulator's venv. Pyright/ruff
// config itself lives in pyproject.toml ([tool.pyright] / [tool.ruff]).
{
  "lsp": {
    "basedpyright": {
      "settings": {
        "python": {
          "pythonPath": ".venv/bin/python"
        }
      }
    },
    "pyright": {
      "settings": {
        "python": {
          "pythonPath": ".venv/bin/python"
        }
      }
    }
  }
}
